abstract: >-
  VEHICLE-CPS is a mathematical framework for mass event security and leader protection based on the 
  Borda Milan Pyramid. It utilizes the E.I.A.R.(V) structured node state and a projection-governed 
  operator to detect and mitigate perimeter breaches and anomalous crowd concentrations in real-time.